{"candidateAnswer":"28 January, 2023","evidence":"[D2:4 | 2:32 pm on 29 January, 2023] Jon: Hey Gina! Thanks for asking. I'm on the hunt for the ideal spot for my dance studio and it's been quite a journey! I've been looking at different places and picturing how the space would look. I even found a place with great natural light! Oh, I've been to Paris yesterday! It was sooo cool.","itemId":"urn:uuid:51c1672f-9187-5c29-9040-52bb66d2ea37","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:c988964e5aead8148b7120394ce9e42c6268160791a5a15376108932fb6cff04","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When was Jon in Paris?","referenceAnswer":"28 January 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"c988964e5aead8148b7120394ce9e42c6268160791a5a15376108932fb6cff04"}}]}